.TH CLIENT 3 "2026-09-22" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test program for libmyutils library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is a driver program that tests the functions provided by
.BR libmyutils .
It tests both string functions and file functions.
.SH FUNCTIONS TESTED
.TP
.B mystrlen
Returns the length of a string.
.TP
.B mystrcpy
Copies a string from source to destination.
.TP
.B mystrncpy
Copies up to n characters from source to destination.
.TP
.B mystrcat
Concatenates two strings.
.TP
.B wordCount
Counts lines, words, and characters in a file.
.TP
.B mygrep
Searches for a pattern in a file and returns matching lines.
